### 1. TEST CSRF TOKEN
GET http://localhost:5000/api/csrf-token
Content-Type: application/json

###

### 2. TEST CUSTOMER REGISTER (dengan JWT userId baru)
POST http://localhost:5000/api/customer/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "phone_number": "081234567890",
  "full_name": "Test User Baru",
  "password": "Test123!@#",
  "address": "Jl. Test No. 123"
}

###

### 3. TEST CUSTOMER LOGIN (dengan JWT userId baru)
POST http://localhost:5000/api/customer/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "phone_number": "081234567890",
  "password": "Test123!@#"
}

###

### 4. TEST GET CART (verify token berfungsi)
# @name cart
GET http://localhost:5000/api/customer/cart
Authorization: Bearer {{LOGIN_TOKEN_HERE}}
Content-Type: application/json

###

### 5. TEST ADD TO CART (verify pessimistic lock)
POST http://localhost:5000/api/customer/cart
Authorization: Bearer {{LOGIN_TOKEN_HERE}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "product_id": "PRODUCT_UUID_HERE",
  "quantity": 2
}

###

### 6. TEST CREATE ORDER (verify race condition fix)
POST http://localhost:5000/api/customer/orders/create
Authorization: Bearer {{LOGIN_TOKEN_HERE}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "items": [
    {
      "product_id": "PRODUCT_UUID_HERE",
      "quantity": 1
    }
  ],
  "delivery_method": "delivery",
  "payment_method": "transfer",
  "delivery_address": "Jl. Test Delivery No. 456",
  "delivery_notes": "Test order dengan race condition fix"
}

###

### 7. TEST GET PRODUCTS (verify indexes performance)
GET http://localhost:5000/api/public/products?page=1&limit=10
Content-Type: application/json

###

### 8. TEST GET PRODUCTS BY CATEGORY (verify category index)
GET http://localhost:5000/api/public/products?category_id=CATEGORY_UUID_HERE&page=1&limit=10
Content-Type: application/json

###

### 9. TEST ADMIN LOGIN
POST http://localhost:5000/api/admin/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "admin123"
}

###

### 10. TEST GET ORDERS (verify order indexes)
GET http://localhost:5000/api/admin/orders?page=1&limit=10
Authorization: Bearer {{ADMIN_TOKEN_HERE}}
Content-Type: application/json
